  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Can we get an option in the advanced graphics settings to globally enable Ambient Occlusion? There was an 'addon' for this in the past and it was really nice to use. It just made the game look better overall, and besides the small performance cost, it had no downside. Looked very nice in pretty much every world, and if a world already had AO it would just use it's settings instead.\nI would preferably like to see an option to toggle forced Ambient Occlusion, change it's type (SAO/MSVO), and it's intensity. But of course toggling it off will still allow it to show in worlds that had it enabled.\nThank you.",
